{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_Customization.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/CustomizationAllTogether.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_PvE.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and reign victorious in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers along with fighting your StickFriends to try and get the highest score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/PvE.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_PvP.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/PvP.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_FunMovement.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with Double Jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Movement.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_LevelEditor.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/LevelEditor.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_GLHF.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2781680?t=1745693193","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2781680?t=1745693193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745693193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745693193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/FeatureList.png?t=1745693193\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_Customization.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/CustomizationAllTogether.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_PvE.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and reign victorious in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers along with fighting your StickFriends to try and get the highest score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/PvE.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_PvP.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/PvP.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_FunMovement.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with Double Jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Movement.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_LevelEditor.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/LevelEditor.gif?t=1745693193\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/Banner_GLHF.png?t=1745693193\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>","developers":["Simple Shark"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/header.jpg?t=1745693193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127611,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127611/movie480.mp4?t=1745693191","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127611/movie_max.mp4?t=1745693191"},"name":"The Stickman Announcement Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/